        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\r\rThree Providence operatives have been spotted &apos;cleaning up&apos; around Janus&apos; old haunts. Your targets, Mogensen, Vue and Rentz plan to gather all the evidence of Janus&apos; existence before eliminating most of the witnesses at the BBQ. This cannot be allowed to happen.\r\rA complication, 47. Rentz is a control freak who will flee at the slightest hint of trouble. Getting spotted by a camera would ruin the mission.\r\rGood luck.",
